; JnsGrid preset — the EXACT real JNS Scalper V22 panel config, for DEMO forward-testing.
; From the JNS panel screenshot: Lot 0.01, Gap 50pt(5pip), Profit £1, Lock £0.50,
; Prot 20pt(2pip), B+S 10pt(1pip), deep stacking, JNS pullback entry ON.
; FATAL-FLAW FIX kept ON (per-side SL £1500 + float/equity backstops) so demo can't wipe out.
; PURPOSE: watch it on live demo fills. Backtest showed +£142k on OHLC but -13/-15% on
; real ticks. The demo (real fills) will show which is true. Watch EQUITY, not banked green.
; Load via: attach JnsGrid to XAUUSD M5 -> Inputs tab -> Load -> this file.
InpLot=0.01
InpGapPoints=50
InpTpMoney=1.0
InpLockMoney=0.5
InpTradeBuy=true
InpTradeSell=true
InpProtPoints=20
InpBSStepPoints=10
InpBeOffsetPoints=5
InpBuyTarget=0.0
InpSellTarget=0.0
InpKeepHedge=2
InpSideSL=1500.0
InpScalpMode=true
InpScalpSlots=90
InpScalpGapPips=5.0
InpScalpMinSecs=5
InpMaxLevels=90
InpMaxFloatingLoss=3000.0
InpEquityStopPct=15.0
InpBasketTP=0.0
InpCloseAllOnStop=true
InpJnsPullback=true
InpPullbackWaitSecs=30
InpPullbackPoints=30
InpJnsTriggerPoints=50
InpMagic=26023332
InpSlippage=30
InpStartRunning=true
InpShowPanel=true
InpEnableLog=true
